# AI credits: enter from the colour cycle with Left (it wraps to the last
# scene). The credits scroll half a pixel a frame, so a full screen of
# text takes about 450 frames to arrive. Then step through the wave
# modes, reverse, pause, and run on until the credits have looped.
#
# The background is a hex dump of the scene's own code, so these CRCs
# change whenever credits.s, or code linked ahead of it, changes (see
# CLAUDE.md).
run 20
press left
run 40
shot entered               7469cc3b # banner, hex dump, title line rippling in at the bottom
run 460
shot melt                  07f5ec9d # full screen: calm in the middle, melting at top and bottom
press c
run 30
shot ripple                ad1f33b5 # C: the same gentle ripple on every line
press c
run 30
shot off                   663e2f95 # C: no wave; text and hex dump both straight
press c
run 30
shot melt-again            2c1b3aa8 # C: back to the edge melt
press b
run 200
shot reverse               7585c87e # B: credits scroll down (title back near the top), hex dump up
press start
run 30
shot paused-a              0fd39892 # Start: paused...
run 60
shot paused-b              0fd39892 # ...so this frame must match paused-a
press start
press b
run 1400
shot looped                635ff7b6 # forward again; credits ended and started over
